    <!--
      The empty state EVERY habit screen shows — M6.8's copy, judged by the user at M6.11, and
      moved out of the Week strings in M8.1 when the Month view turned out to need the identical
      thing. The copy is UNDESIGNED.

      ⚠ It is habits_empty_* rather than week_empty_* because habits are GLOBAL: they are the
      checkbox columns of one Notion database (ADR-010), so a screen is empty when the app has no
